            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<i>Igor</i> must <strong>escape from a mental asylum</strong>, but it’s not going to be easy. There are two (2) rather obvious reasons:<br><br>1. <i>Igor</i> is constrained by <strong>a straitjacket</strong>.<br>2. The asylum’s corridors are filled with <strong>tranquilizers-ready guards</strong> (and other obstacles).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/f84a60d85df4414060f57d23b1002250.poster.avif?t=1655225642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/f84a60d85df4414060f57d23b1002250.webm?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/f84a60d85df4414060f57d23b1002250.mp4?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In addition to the dangers haunting outside, <i>Igor</i> is going through <strong>a war inside his head</strong>: his <strong>psychotic imaginary friend</strong>, <i>Flead</i>, is constantly demanding him to cancel his stupid escaping attempt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/b53c6ad1f6f41e009504cef991a17de4.poster.avif?t=1655225642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/b53c6ad1f6f41e009504cef991a17de4.webm?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/b53c6ad1f6f41e009504cef991a17de4.mp4?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The INSANE story takes place in <strong>a mysterious mental asylum</strong> which is known from its <strong>dark-ish history</strong> of utilizing questionable alternative treatments. The only thing even more mysterious, is <strong>the genius mastermind</strong>, <i>Head Doctor</i>, who is running the place...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/d6043c3fbd9a9544347bcb634e67ccf1.avif?t=1655225642\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><strong>Three (3) multi-level game worlds</strong>, each of them packed with unique gameplay features<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Special Patients</i> has <strong>kittens</strong>.<br></li><li><i>Ancient Section</i> has <strong>abandoned motorized machines</strong> and <strong>dynamite</strong>.<br></li><li><i>Top Secret Area</i> has <strong>teleports</strong> and other cool hi-tech devices from the future.<br></li><li>... and <strong>much more</strong>!</li></ul><br>All asylum’s <strong>secrets shall be... unveiled!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Collect</strong> <i>Random Notes</i> that our scatterbrained <i>Head Doctor</i> has left behind! <br></li><li><strong>Discover</strong> <i>Fine Pieces of Art</i>!<br></li><li><strong>Hoard</strong> <i>Funny Hats</i>!<br></li><li><strong>Reveal</strong> the ultimate truth, <i>The Understanding to Everything</i>!</li></ul><br><strong>Greatly praised OST</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The soundtrack was nominated as &quot;<strong>Best Game Music</strong>&quot; at Game Audio Awards 2018.<br></li><li><strong>11 pieces of music</strong> composed &amp; arranged by maestros, <i>Toni Aaltola</i> and <i>Tommi Ilonen</i>.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<i>Igor</i> must <strong>escape from a mental asylum</strong>, but it’s not going to be easy. There are two (2) rather obvious reasons:<br><br>1. <i>Igor</i> is constrained by <strong>a straitjacket</strong>.<br>2. The asylum’s corridors are filled with <strong>tranquilizers-ready guards</strong> (and other obstacles).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/f84a60d85df4414060f57d23b1002250.poster.avif?t=1655225642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/f84a60d85df4414060f57d23b1002250.webm?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/f84a60d85df4414060f57d23b1002250.mp4?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In addition to the dangers haunting outside, <i>Igor</i> is going through <strong>a war inside his head</strong>: his <strong>psychotic imaginary friend</strong>, <i>Flead</i>, is constantly demanding him to cancel his stupid escaping attempt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/b53c6ad1f6f41e009504cef991a17de4.poster.avif?t=1655225642\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/b53c6ad1f6f41e009504cef991a17de4.webm?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/b53c6ad1f6f41e009504cef991a17de4.mp4?t=1655225642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The INSANE story takes place in <strong>a mysterious mental asylum</strong> which is known from its <strong>dark-ish history</strong> of utilizing questionable alternative treatments. The only thing even more mysterious, is <strong>the genius mastermind</strong>, <i>Head Doctor</i>, who is running the place...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/654430/extras/d6043c3fbd9a9544347bcb634e67ccf1.avif?t=1655225642\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><strong>Three (3) multi-level game worlds</strong>, each of them packed with unique gameplay features<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Special Patients</i> has <strong>kittens</strong>.<br></li><li><i>Ancient Section</i> has <strong>abandoned motorized machines</strong> and <strong>dynamite</strong>.<br></li><li><i>Top Secret Area</i> has <strong>teleports</strong> and other cool hi-tech devices from the future.<br></li><li>... and <strong>much more</strong>!</li></ul><br>All asylum’s <strong>secrets shall be... unveiled!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Collect</strong> <i>Random Notes</i> that our scatterbrained <i>Head Doctor</i> has left behind! <br></li><li><strong>Discover</strong> <i>Fine Pieces of Art</i>!<br></li><li><strong>Hoard</strong> <i>Funny Hats</i>!<br></li><li><strong>Reveal</strong> the ultimate truth, <i>The Understanding to Everything</i>!</li></ul><br><strong>Greatly praised OST</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The soundtrack was nominated as &quot;<strong>Best Game Music</strong>&quot; at Game Audio Awards 2018.<br></li><li><strong>11 pieces of music</strong> composed &amp; arranged by maestros, <i>Toni Aaltola</i> and <i>Tommi Ilonen</i>.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Escaping from a Mental Asylum Has Never Been This Much of.. Fun.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
